Each staged source version contains .servicetalk-source-bundle.json with its original SourceBundle.
Publish the manifest atomically beside source files before exposing a new cache directory.
For existing caches, require the same original source bytes and manifest; install missing legacy metadata atomically.
Inherited constructors, blocks and clones decode the bounded manifest and verify its digest and directory identity.
Build-generated headers, lockfiles, binaries and other outputs cannot change inherited source snapshots.
Legacy caches without a manifest may be inherited only when their collected files still match the directory digest.
